---
// The skill lifecycle, one step per row. Each row shows the artifact that step
// actually produces. Step 01 is agbox capture, which is not shipped yet.
---

<section class="section how" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="h2">From a prompt you keep retyping to a skill the whole team runs.</h2>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step__copy">
          <span class="step__num">01</span>
          <h3>Notice <span class="preview-tag">agbox · preview</span></h3>
          <p>
            agbox reads your local Claude Code and Codex sessions and spots the work you explain over and over.
            Sessions stay on your machine, encrypted under <code>~/.agbox</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="artifact workflow-card">
          <div class="artifact__head">
            <span>Recorded workflow</span>
            <span class="workflow-card__evidence">Seen 4 times across 2 projects</span>
          </div>
          <div class="workflow-card__body" data-print>
            <p class="workflow-card__name">release-checklist</p>
            <dl>
              <dt>Applies to</dt>
              <dd>“cut a release”, “prepare v0.x”, “write release notes”</dd>
            </dl>
            <dl>
              <dt>Plan</dt>
              <dd>
                <ol>
                  <li>Read commits since the last tag</li>
                  <li>Run <code>make test</code> and <code>make lint</code></li>
                  <li>Draft notes in <code>docs/release-notes/</code></li>
                </ol>
              </dd>
            </dl>
            <p class="workflow-card__note">Instructions only. No commands are re-run.</p>
            <div class="workflow-card__actions">
              <span class="btn btn--primary">Save as skill</span>
              <span class="btn btn--outline">Not now</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <div class="step__copy">
          <span class="step__num">02</span>
          <h3>Review</h3>
          <p>
            A skill is a folder with a <code>SKILL.md</code>, declared in <code>gandalf.toml</code>.
            It lands as a pull request, so your team reviews it like any other change.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="artifact diff">
          <div class="artifact__head">
            <span>Add release-checklist skill</span>
            <span class="diff__stat"><b>+14</b> <i>−0</i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="diff__file">gandalf.toml</div>
          <pre class="diff__code" data-print><span class="ctx">  [[skills]]</span><span class="ctx">  name   = "team-reviewer"</span><span class="ctx">  source = "./.gandalf/skills/team-reviewer"</span><span class="ctx"> </span><span class="add">+ [[skills]]</span><span class="add">+ name   = "release-checklist"</span><span class="add">+ source = "./.gandalf/skills/release-checklist"</span></pre>
          <div class="diff__file">.gandalf/skills/release-checklist/SKILL.md</div>
          <pre class="diff__code" data-print><span class="add">+ ---</span><span class="add">+ name: release-checklist</span><span class="add">+ description: Prepare a release the way this repo does it</span><span class="add">+ ---</span><span class="add">+ 1. Read commits since the last tag.</span><span class="add">+ 2. Run make test and make lint. Stop on failure.</span><span class="add">+ 3. Draft notes in docs/release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md.</span></pre>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <div class="step__copy">
          <span class="step__num">03</span>
          <h3>Install everywhere</h3>
          <p>
            After the merge, <code>gandalf apply</code> copies the skill into each agent's own skills folder.
            It snapshots first and leaves personal skills alone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="artifact tree">
          <div class="artifact__head"><span>After gandalf apply</span></div>
          <pre class="tree__body" data-print><span class="line"><span class="dim">.gandalf/skills/</span>release-checklist/SKILL.md</span><span class="line"><span class="arrow">├─▸</span> <span class="dim">~/.claude/skills/</span>release-checklist/   <span class="agent">Claude Code</span></span><span class="line"><span class="arrow">├─▸</span> <span class="dim">~/.codex/skills/</span>release-checklist/    <span class="agent">Codex</span></span><span class="line"><span class="arrow">└─▸</span> <span class="dim">~/.cursor/skills/</span>release-checklist/   <span class="agent">Cursor</span></span></pre>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <div class="step__copy">
          <span class="step__num">04</span>
          <h3>Stay in sync</h3>
          <p>
            On a laptop, <code>gandalf check</code> lists agents that are missing a skill or carry an old copy.
            In CI, <code>gandalf check --ci</code> fails the pull request that lets the repo drift from <code>gandalf.toml</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="artifact checks">
          <div class="artifact__head"><span>Checks on #214</span></div>
          <ul class="checks__list" data-print>
            <li><span class="checks__icon is-ok" aria-label="passed">✓</span> test <span class="dim">1m 52s</span></li>
            <li><span class="checks__icon is-ok" aria-label="passed">✓</span> lint <span class="dim">24s</span></li>
            <li class="is-fail">
              <span class="checks__icon is-fail" aria-label="failed">✕</span>
              gandalf check --ci
              <span class="checks__detail">skill release-checklist: .gandalf/skills/release-checklist/SKILL.md not found</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    margin: 64px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .step__copy {
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
  }

  .step__num {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--faint-foreground);
  }

  .step h3 {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .step p {
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .step p code,
  .workflow-card code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .dim {
    color: var(--faint-foreground);
  }

  /* 01 · Recorded workflow card */
  .workflow-card__evidence {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .workflow-card__body {
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .workflow-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .workflow-card dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .workflow-card dt {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .workflow-card dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .workflow-card dd ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .workflow-card dd li + li {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .workflow-card__note {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .workflow-card__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .workflow-card__actions .btn {
    height: 32px;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* 02 · Pull request diff */
  .diff__stat {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .diff__stat b {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a7f37;
  }

  .diff__stat i {
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .diff__file {
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-strong);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .diff__code {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .diff__code:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .diff__code span {
    display: block;
    padding: 0 14px;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .diff__code .ctx {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .diff__code .add {
    background: #ecfdf0;
    color: #14532d;
  }

  /* 03 · Install tree */
  .tree__body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 2;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .tree__body .line {
    display: block;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .tree__body .arrow {
    color: var(--faint-foreground);
  }

  .tree__body .agent {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  /* 04 · CI checks */
  .checks__list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 6px 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .checks__list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
  }

  .checks__list li + li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .checks__list .dim {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .checks__icon {
    width: 14px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .checks__icon.is-ok {
    color: #1a7f37;
  }

  .checks__icon.is-fail {
    color: #cf222e;
  }

  .checks__detail {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    padding-left: 24px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .step {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 36px 0;
    }

    .step__copy {
      position: static;
    }

    .tree__body .agent {
      display: none;
    }

    .workflow-card__evidence {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
